          "settings": {
          }
        },
        "6cfb168a-4ac0-4014-8a56-489215e7908d": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to apply?",
            "content": "<p>Spray 1-2 pumps directly onto your scalp in <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">each<\/span> of your thinning areas. <\/p><p>Massage into your scalp with fingertips. <\/p><p>For best results, use our scalp-stimulating brush before you spray your scalp, to get the blood flow up to the scalp and clean away any debris. <\/p><p>Use once daily, either AM or PM.  <\/p><p>** This is a Leave-On Treatment**<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "ce4c547f-45b1-42da-971b-a436bdcdb9db": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does it work?",
            "content": "<p>Our proprietary blend was specifically formulated to give you thicker, fuller, stronger hair. Get ready to love your hair again. <\/p><p><strong>Decrease Shedding <\/strong><\/p><p>Acetyl tetrapeptide-3 is a peptide which has a direct effect on the hair follicle and its vitality. The peptide signals tissue remodeling of the hair follicle to grow, which helps anchor the follicle in your scalp so that it’s stronger.<\/p><p><strong>Blocks DHT<\/strong><\/p><p>Biochanin A, extracted from Red Clover (Trifolium pretense), is a powerful flavonoid. It is an effective inhibitor of 5-α-reductase (type I & II) activity, DHT Modulation. Reducing the hair follicle miniaturization process. <\/p><p>\t<\/p><p><strong>Anti-Aging & Scalp Health<\/strong><\/p><p>Our apple cell stem culture blend (High in antioxidants) is a unique and revolutionary ingredient able to protect the most precious hair cells—the hair stem cells—against premature aging and loss.<\/p><p><strong>No More Breakage<\/strong><\/p><p>Caffeine and Niacinamide coat the hair, helping it appear instantly thicker, and remain protected from breakage.<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "14f330ae-542a-4544-93b0-556a5ca99b95": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients:",
            "content": "<p>Water, Alcohol, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Sorbitan Oleate Decylglucoside Crosspolymer, Dextran, Niacinamide, Caffeine, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-3, Trifolium Pratense (Clover) Flower Extract, Panthenol (Vitamin B5), Malus Domestica Fruit Cell Culture Extract, Xanthan Gum, Lecithin, Polysorbate-20, Sodium Benzoate, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate.<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        }
      },
